msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Softastur"

msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "alministradores@softastur.org"

#: DriverManager.cpp:248 Module.cpp:220
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The package system could not be initialized, your configuration may be "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"Nun pudo aniciase'l paquete del sistema, la to configuración quiciabes tea "
"rota."

#: DriverManager.cpp:253
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"Another application seems to be using the package system at this time. You "
"must close all other package managers before you will be able to install or "
"remove any packages."
msgstr ""
"Otra aplicación paez tar usando'l sistema de paquetes nesti momentu. Tienes "
"de zarrar tolos otros xestores de paquetes enantes que seyas quién a "
"instalar o desaniciar cualesquier paquete."

#: DriverManager.cpp:260
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"You do not have enough disk space in the directory at %1 to continue with "
"this operation."
msgstr ""
"Nun tienes espaciu en discu abondo nel direutoriu en %1 pa siguir con esta "
"operación."

#: DriverManager.cpp:266
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Could not download packages"
msgstr "Nun pudieron baxase los paquetes"

#: DriverManager.cpp:269
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "An error occurred while applying changes:"
msgstr "Asocedió un fallu entrín s'aplicaben les camudancies:"

#: DriverManager.cpp:273
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"This operation cannot continue since proper authorization was not provided"
msgstr ""
"Esta operación nun pue siguir darréu que nun s'apurrió l'autorización "
"afayadiza"

#: DriverManager.cpp:277
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"It appears that the QApt worker has either crashed or disappeared. Please "
"report a bug to the QApt maintainers"
msgstr ""
"Paez que'l trabayador QApt o cascó o desapaeció. Informa d'un fallu a los "
"caltenedores de QApt, por favor"

#: DriverManager.cpp:285
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The following package has not been verified by its author. Downloading "
"untrusted packages has been disallowed by your current configuration."
msgid_plural ""
"The following packages have not been verified by their authors. Downloading "
"untrusted packages has been disallowed by your current configuration."
msgstr[0] ""
"Nun pudo verificase pol autor el paquete de software de darréu. "
"Deshabilitóse pola to configuración actual la descarga de paquetes que nun "
"son d'enfotu."
msgstr[1] ""
"Nun pudieron verificase pol autor los paquetes de software de darréu. "
"Deshabilitóse pola to configuración actual la descarga de paquetes que nun "
"son d'enfotu."

#: DriverManager.cpp:298
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The package \"%1\" has not been found among your software sources. "
"Therefore, it cannot be installed. "
msgstr ""
"Nun s'alcontró'l paquete «%1» pente les tos fontes de software. Poro, nun "
"pue instalase."

#: DriverManager.cpp:310
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Media Change Required"
msgstr "Cambéu de medios riquíu"

#: DriverManager.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Please insert %1 into <filename>%2</filename>"
msgstr "Inxerta %1 en <filename>%2</filename>, por favor"

#: DriverManager.cpp:320
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Warning - Unverified Software"
msgstr "Alvertencia - Software non verificáu"

#: DriverManager.cpp:322
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The following piece of software cannot be verified. <warning>Installing "
"unverified software represents a security risk, as the presence of "
"unverifiable software can be a sign of tampering.</warning> Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgid_plural ""
"The following pieces of software cannot be verified. <warning>Installing "
"unverified software represents a security risk, as the presence of "
"unverifiable software can be a sign of tampering.</warning> Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgstr[0] ""
"Nun pue verificase la pieza de software de darréu. <warning>Instalar "
"software ensin verificar representa un riesgu de seguranza darréu que la "
"presencia de software que nun pue verificase pue ser seña de manipulación.</"
"warning> ¿Deseyes siguir?"
msgstr[1] ""
"Nun puen verificase les pieces de software de darréu. <warning>Instalar "
"software ensin verificar representa un riesgu de seguranza darréu que la "
"presencia de software que nun pue verificase pue ser seña de manipulación.</"
"warning> ¿Deseyes siguir?"

#: DriverManager.cpp:341
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Configuration File Changed"
msgstr "Camudóse'l ficheru de configuración"

#: DriverManager.cpp:343
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label Notifies a config file change"
msgid ""
"A new version of the configuration file <filename>%1</filename> is "
"available, but your version has been modified. Would you like to keep your "
"current version or install the new version?"
msgstr ""
"Ta disponible una versión nueva del ficheru de configuración <filename>%1</"
"filename> pero modificóse la to versión . ¿Prestaríate caltener la to "
"versión actual o instalar la versión nueva?"

#: DriverManager.cpp:348
msgctxt "@action Use the new config file"
msgid "Use New Version"
msgstr "Usar versión nueva"

#: DriverManager.cpp:349
msgctxt "@action Keep the old config file"
msgid "Keep Old Version"
msgstr "Caltener versión vieya"

#: DriverWidget.cpp:45
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info %1 is hardware vendor, %2 is hardware model"
msgid "<title>%1 %2</title>"
msgstr "<title>%1 %2</title>"

#: DriverWidget.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Manually installed 3rd party driver"
msgid "This device is using a manually-installed driver : (%1)"
msgstr "Esti preséu ta usando un controlador instaláu a mano: (%1)"

#: DriverWidget.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"%1 is description and %2 is package name; when driver is recommended for use"
msgid "Using %1 from %2 (Recommended Driver)"
msgstr "Usando %1 de %2 (Controlador aconseyáu)"

#: DriverWidget.cpp:91
#, kde-format
msgctxt "%1 is description and %2 is package name"
msgid "Using %1 from %2"
msgstr "Usando %1 de %2"

#: DriverWidget.cpp:98
msgctxt "The driver is under a open source license"
msgid "Open Source Driver"
msgstr "Controlador llibre"

#: DriverWidget.cpp:101
msgctxt "The driver is under a proprietary license"
msgid "Proprietary Driver"
msgstr "Controlador propietariu"

